Z||000000||84 2in1||06-12-2001||10:50 PM||||Where is it gonna end! Every time I shift into 2nd gear it rakes/grinds. all the other gears are ok just 2nd . Also this is the 2nd tranny to do this.  Both were 4 speeds w/4.10 gears and both had gear lube in them (this one that is in the car had only a quart of the gear oil). Could I need to bleed out the clutch and adjust the cables again? Changed out the master cyl. and didnt bleed the clutch . have to push the pedel to the floor to shift gears . also changed out the cables due to a previous fire. Slowly going APE SHASTA!-B-<P>------------------<BR>If it works DON"T FIX IT!||||reg||8
Z||000001||mrgone||06-13-2001||03:19 AM||||dont you have to push the clutch to the floor to shift gears in any car?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fformula88||06-13-2001||08:00 AM||||My fathers 85 SE has to have the pedal put to the floor to shift gears too.  Everything else is working ok.  I think its just the nature of the transmission.  I've heard others comment on this as well.  Have you replaced the clutch pedal?  The original ones in older Fieros are aluminum and often bend.  Replacing it with a steel pedal may help some if it is bent.  Good luck!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Formula88||06-13-2001||12:50 PM||||Correct me if I'm wrong, but do the 4-speed Muncie's use gear oil?  The Muncie/Getrag 5-speed in my Fiero specs GM Syncromesh, but you can also use 10W-30 motor oil.  Gear oil would be WAY too thick.  Double-check your manual to be sure.||||reg||5
Z||000004||88CoupeV6||06-13-2001||06:16 PM||||Only stuff I use is Redline MTL Better than Motor oil or Synchromesh. I've<BR>been using it for a wile. Smoothes the shifting right out.<P>Read about it here <A HREF="http://www.redlineoil.com/redlineoil/mtlti.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.redlineoil.com/redlineoil/mtlti.htm</A> <P>I love it. It is great stuff<P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||3
